tem LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"Submersibler Deep Well High Quality Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/3-5-inch-submersible-well-water-pump47154201020.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Submersibler Deep Well High Quality Pump</h1>\n<p>​3.5 inch submersible well water pump is a kind of new superior products that produced by introducing America and Italy pump technology. The main parts of this pump are stainless steel material. Suitable for water supply, mainly for irrigation of farmland.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"64954639\"/></p><p><strong>Submersibler Deep Well High Quality Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231349042246020.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Submersibler Deep Well High Quality Pump is one of the most popular products in JIADI gallery.  Both our products and service have attracted many customers all over the world. This product could be applied to house using, farm irrigation, factory and so on.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model </p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">90QJ</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\">                 Head</td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">90-155m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Flow Rate</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-4.2 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.25-1.8kW/ 0.33-2.4HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">87 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">638mm-1335mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1-1.25 inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">240 V, 380V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">12 months</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231351097510128.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231348589313165.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Our advantages</strong></p><p><br/></p><p>Over 30 years experience of manufacturing pumps and motors .</p><p>100 percent copper wire.</p><p>100 percent testing system.</p><p>Frontier technology.</p><p>The motor starts up low voltage and the current is far less than traditional hardware startup technology.</p><p>Professional International Trade Sales Team, superior customer care.</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>4. Application</strong></p><p>Submersibler Deep Well High Quality Pump is mainly used for all kinds of water supply, fountain, solar system and all other field requires submersible water pump for irrigation, widely used in industries, agricultural irrigation, petrochemical industries, medicinal industries, and all kinds of water process.</p><p><img alt=\"image021(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231359336041629.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>5. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>Q1: Do you have a catalogue? Can you send me the catalogue to have a check of all your products?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, for getting catalog please contact us online or send us an Email.</p><p><strong>Q2:Can you make customized products and customized packing?</strong></p><p>A: OEM and ODM are welcomed. We are focusing on customer service. </p><p><strong>Q3: How could I confirm the quality?</strong></p><p>A: Before order, you could check the sample at first; Before shipment, we accept the inspection from the third inspection institute suction.</p><p><strong>Q4: How to ship my order ? Is it safe?</strong></p><p>A: For small orders, we will send it by Express, such as DHL,FedEx,,UPS,TNT,EMS. That’s a Door to Door service.</p><p>For big orders, we will send them by Air or By sea. The good package could ensure</p><p>the safety. We will be responsible to any product damage caused on delivery.</p><p><strong>Q5:Do you have a guarantee of your product quality?</strong></p><p>A: One year guarantee. If the damage is caused by product quality problem, we offer replacement or maintenance service in free of charge.</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: submersibler deep well high quality pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-inch-submersible-screw-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Submersible Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-inch-submersible-screw-pump08365148068a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-screw-pump/3-inch-submersible-screw-pump\">3 Inch Submersible Screw Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/well-pump\"><img alt=\"Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/well-pump41192001833a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/well-pump\">Well Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-5-submersible-pump/90qjd-deep-well-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"90QJD Dee